WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:17.572
Katie and Joy put their bikes in the rack at Boone Elementary School.

2
00:00:17.573 --> 00:00:21.395
"The first day of school!" said Joy.

3
00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:25.087
"Yep!" said Katie. "Today is a fresh start.

4
00:00:25.088 --> 00:00:26.562
A clean slate!

5
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:30.750
And I'm going to have a great year in fourth grade."

6
00:00:30.751 --> 00:00:33.030
Laura wheeled up beside them.

7
00:00:33.031 --> 00:00:36.101
"What's new?" she asked.

8
00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:38.622
"Everything," said Katie.

9
00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:42.972
"A brand-new beginning of a brand-new school year!"

10
00:00:42.973 --> 00:00:49.507
"And new outfits—shirts, jeans, sneakers," said Joy.

11
00:00:49.508 --> 00:00:53.237
"Totally all new," said Katie.

12
00:00:53.238 --> 00:00:57.538
"Well, same old backpacks," said Joy.

13
00:00:57.539 --> 00:01:00.772
"I've got something new too," said Laura.

14
00:01:00.773 --> 00:01:02.119
"Here's a clue.

15
00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.008
I can see you very clearly."

16
00:01:06.009 --> 00:01:10.403
"New glasses!" said Joy. "I like them."

17
00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:14.249
The three girls headed in the front door.

18
00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.020
Ms. Olson stood outside her office.

19
00:01:17.021 --> 00:01:19.439
"Welcome back, girls," she said.

20
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:22.112
"Are you ready for fourth grade?"

21
00:01:22.113 --> 00:01:25.246
"Yes, we are!" said Joy.

22
00:01:25.247 --> 00:01:30.591
"But is fourth grade ready for us?" said Katie. "HA!"

23
00:01:30.592 --> 00:01:36.279
Joy smiled. "Katie already said she is going to have a great year."

24
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.018
"That's right!" Katie replied. Ms. Olson smiled.

25
00:01:41.019 --> 00:01:45.488
The girls marched down the hallway and past the third-grade room.

26
00:01:45.489 --> 00:01:50.594
"Hello, Mr. Higgins!" they called.

27
00:01:50.595 --> 00:01:55.388
Ms. Barrow, the fourth-grade teacher, stood by her classroom door.

28
00:01:55.389 --> 00:01:59.427
Her curly hair was twisted on top of her head.

29
00:01:59.428 --> 00:02:03.934
"Hello, girls!" she said. "Now let's see."

30
00:02:03.935 --> 00:02:06.561
She looked at each face.

31
00:02:06.562 --> 00:02:08.649
"You are Laura Layman.

32
00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:12.276
And you are the Donovan twins, right?"

33
00:02:12.277 --> 00:02:15.149
Katie nodded and pointed to her sister.

34
00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.936
"She's Joy. And I'm Katie."

35
00:02:18.937 --> 00:02:22.424
She wiggled her eyebrows to make her bangs move.

36
00:02:22.425 --> 00:02:26.049
"The one with bangs," she added.

37
00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:30.970
"Okay," said Ms. Barrow, smiling. "Got it!"

38
00:02:30.971 --> 00:02:34.168
The girls stepped into the classroom.

39
00:02:34.169 --> 00:02:38.916
"New grade, new teacher, new room," Katie said.

40
00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:41.209
She looked around.

41
00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.385
Her eyes popped wide open.

42
00:02:43.386 --> 00:02:47.802
"Who are Luke and Carlos talking to?" she said.

43
00:02:47.803 --> 00:02:50.719
"A new girl?" said Joy.

44
00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.066
"Come on," said Katie.

45
00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:57.662
She marched over to where the new girl stood by the window.

46
00:02:57.663 --> 00:03:02.967
"Meet Olivia. She's from New York City," said Luke with a big smile.

47
00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:06.395
Katie thought it was a goofy smile.

48
00:03:06.396 --> 00:03:10.116
"Hi, I'm Olivia Sprinkle," said the girl.

49
00:03:10.117 --> 00:03:13.334
She had dark hair and brown eyes.

50
00:03:13.335 --> 00:03:15.283
"Hello," said Laura.

51
00:03:15.284 --> 00:03:19.211
She reached out and touched the string of beads the girl was wearing.

52
00:03:19.212 --> 00:03:21.942
"This is cool," she said.

53
00:03:21.943 --> 00:03:27.174
"Thanks!" said Olivia. "It's a kukui nut necklace."

54
00:03:27.175 --> 00:03:31.270
"A what nut necklace?" said Katie.

55
00:03:31.271 --> 00:03:33.879
"Kukui nut," said the new girl.

56
00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.443
"I got it on vacation in Hawaii this summer."

57
00:03:37.444 --> 00:03:44.847
"Hawaii!" said Carlos. "Wow! Did you see a volcano explode?"

58
00:03:44.848 --> 00:03:51.220
Olivia laughed. "No, I didn't!" she said.

59
00:03:51.221 --> 00:03:54.863
"Whoever heard of a nut necklace?" said Katie.

60
00:03:54.864 --> 00:03:59.772
"That's nutty!" No one paid any attention to her.

61
00:03:59.773 --> 00:04:03.530
"Did you swim in the ocean?" asked Laura.

62
00:04:03.531 --> 00:04:09.362
"Sure!" said Olivia. "And I rode on a surfboard!"

63
00:04:09.363 --> 00:04:12.642
"Excellent!" said Luke.

64
00:04:12.643 --> 00:04:17.498
"We went to Big Surf Water Park for a whole day," said Katie.

65
00:04:17.499 --> 00:04:20.182
Nobody seemed to hear her.

66
00:04:20.183 --> 00:04:24.597
"Did you go fishing in the ocean?" Luke asked Olivia.

67
00:04:24.598 --> 00:04:29.148
"Yes," said Olivia. "We went on a big sailboat!

68
00:04:29.149 --> 00:04:32.376
My mom caught a swordfish!"

69
00:04:32.377 --> 00:04:35.942
"Did you catch a shark?" asked Carlos.

70
00:04:35.943 --> 00:04:37.853
Katie rolled her eyes.

71
00:04:37.854 --> 00:04:40.659
"Catch a shark!" she cried.

72
00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:44.265
"Are you crazy?" Carlos frowned.

73
00:04:44.266 --> 00:04:49.678
"No sharks," said Olivia. "But we saw dolphins!"

74
00:04:49.679 --> 00:04:53.748
"Dolphins! I love dolphins!" said Joy.

75
00:04:53.749 --> 00:04:56.466
Katie poked her in the ribs.

76
00:04:56.467 --> 00:04:59.364
"Ouch!" cried Joy.

77
00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:03.532
Suddenly someone tapped Katie on the shoulder.

78
00:05:03.533 --> 00:05:05.913
It was Ms. Barrow.

79
00:05:05.914 --> 00:05:09.630
"Uh-oh," thought Katie.

80
00:05:09.631 --> 00:05:16.647
"Katie, in the fourth grade, we do not jab people in the ribs," the teacher said.

81
00:05:16.648 --> 00:05:21.174
"Okay," Katie mumbled. "Sorry."

82
00:05:21.175 --> 00:05:25.280
Ms. Barrow nodded and then clapped her hands twice.

83
00:05:25.281 --> 00:05:28.932
"Let's find our desks," she called.

84
00:05:28.933 --> 00:05:31.382
"Luke and Larry, you're here.

85
00:05:31.383 --> 00:05:33.388
Katie, this is your seat.

86
00:05:33.389 --> 00:05:38.052
Olivia, you'll sit here, next to Katie. And Laura . . ."

87
00:05:38.053 --> 00:05:39.986
"It's the first day of school.

88
00:05:39.987 --> 00:05:42.021
And you already got in trouble,"

89
00:05:42.022 --> 00:05:45.469
Joy whispered as she passed Katie's desk.

90
00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:48.647
"I know," Katie thought glumly.

91
00:05:48.648 --> 00:05:54.212
"So much for my fresh start."
